  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >
  A runnable transcription of three independent research constructions.
  chronometrics/ is a self-contained, internally-audited mathematical
  registry built from one exact triangle (144, 138, 116): a Brocard
  phase, an exact q-screen leakage defect, a frozen log-time phase law,
  a locked recurrence-gate/spectral-operator model, the dark-to-bright
  chronometric separation, and a geophysical bridge for eventual testing
  against real magnetometer/geomagnetic data. This construction is
  explicitly NOT a confirmed physical law -- see each module's status
  tags (EXACT / FROZEN / AUDITED / REJECTED / BRIDGE) and the boundary
  statement in chronometrics/README.md. zero_point_energy/ is a
  correctness-audited transcription of mainstream, textbook QFT
  vacuum-energy mechanics (Casimir effect, Casimir-Polder, dynamical
  Casimir effect, Unruh/Hawking temperature), auditing the source
  document "Zero-Point Energy: First Principles, Units, and Observables"
  (Lockwood, Cyrek, Burkeen & Hansley). d067_art_v1/ transcribes the
  reduced-order architecture audited in "Adaptive-Resonance-Tracked
  Phononic Piezoelectric Light Source: From 100 Phononic Metacrystals to
  D067-ART-v1 Adaptive Resonance Tracking" (Lockwood, September 2026): a
  design program that screened 100 phononic metacrystal families and
  closed on D067, a nested inertial phononic resonator coupled to a
  PZT-5A transducer with adaptive resonance tracking and adaptive
  electrical loading, after rejecting a passive fixed-frequency design on
  manufacturing-robustness grounds. REDUCED-ORDER ARCHITECTURE FREEZE --
  NOT EXPERIMENTALLY VALIDATED; no 3-D tensor piezoelectric finite-element
  model or bench prototype has been built. experiments/ holds numerical
  falsification and synthetic-control studies, including a blind test of
  whether the chronometrics log-periodic frequency emerges from
  first-principles Josephson-junction network dynamics (it does not, in
  the current reduced-order model -- see SCIENTIFIC_VALIDATION.md).
  Licensing is scoped per content type, not uniform across the
  repository: see LICENSES.md for the exact split (source code is
  MIT-licensed; scientific prose, reports, and original documentation and
  figures are CC-BY-4.0), and LICENSE / LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.md for the full
  license texts.
keywords:
  - chronometrics
  - log-periodic
  - Josephson junction
  - zero-point energy
